I am sorry about posting this to net.sources, but it seemed
the most logical place. Recently I distributed xlisp v1.4
to net.sources, but failed to include a make file or information
about building xlisp. I will correct that problem :

	Building xlisp v1.4 is simple, just type the
	following command :

	cc -o xlisp *.c

That does it (you might want to include the O switch, but it
isn't needed).


